  eventID: WorkerRepeated
  dialogueLines:
  - "This guy\u2019s probably busy. Let\u2019s go look at something else"
  - "He looks pretty busy. Come on, let\u2019s leave him to it"
  - "I think this guy has enough going on. Let\u2019s find something else to look
    at"
  - "Yeah, he seems occupied. Let\u2019s go bother someone else"
  - "This guy looks like he\u2019s actually working. Let\u2019s leave him alone and
    move on"
  - "He seems pretty busy with whatever that is. Come on, there\u2019s other stuff
    to see"
  - "I think we\u2019ve seen enough here. Let\u2019s go find something more interesting"
  - "Looks like he\u2019s got things under control. Let\u2019s move along"
  - "He\u2019s clearly got work to do. Let\u2019s not stand here watching him"
  - "Yeah, I\u2019m pretty sure he doesn\u2019t need us hovering around. Let\u2019s
