  - "This guy\u2019s got enough on his plate. Come on, let\u2019s keep moving"
  - "He looks occupied, so let\u2019s give him some space and find something else"
  - "I think we\u2019re interrupting whatever he\u2019s doing. Let\u2019s go"
  - "He\u2019s busy. We\u2019ve got better things to do than watch him work"
  - "Alright, nothing to see here. Let\u2019s find something else to entertain ourselves
